@startuml
title Process Sale State Machine

[*] --> WaitingForSale

state WaitingForSale
WaitingForSale : entry / Wait for new sale

state AddingItems
AddingItems : entry / Add items to sale

state PaymentVerification
PaymentVerification : entry / Verify payment method

state CompletingSale
CompletingSale : entry / Complete sale after payment approval

state FinishedSale
FinishedSale : entry / Return to waiting state after sale completion

WaitingForSale --> AddingItems : New sale detected

AddingItems --> PaymentVerification : All items added

PaymentVerification --> CompletingSale : Payment method verified

CompletingSale --> FinishedSale : Sale completed successfully

PaymentVerification --> WaitingForSale : Invalid payment method
PaymentVerification --> WaitingForSale : Payment verification failed

AddingItems --> WaitingForSale : Cancel sale by customer

WaitingForSale --> [*] : No new sales detected

@enduml
